ists": ["Arch Inside"], "duration": 154, "title": "In a city buried under metres of snow, these houses sank the middle o...", "description": "In a city buried under metres of snow, these houses sank the middle of their roofs on purpose. A steep roof throws the snow down, but the heap buries the windows and the door, crushes the neighbour's fence, and in Hokkaido's packed streets there is no land to drop it on at all. Melt it with heating cables and it refreezes into giant icicles and bursts the drainpipe. Shed it and you are buried; melt it and it bursts. What the architects did instead is in the video. #hokkaido #sapporo #snow #roof #architecture ", "timestamp": 1788994884, "view_count": 253100, "like_count": 8321, "repost_count": 771, "comment_count": 89, "save_count": 1161, "thumbnails": [{"id": "dynamicCover", "url": "https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-p-0037/octfckGvELApIaEQeAI4A5IADv8zejvhVOTCAd~tplv-tiktokx-origin.image?dr=9636&x-expires=1794114000&x-signature=QcPq4nUDYqX7fIFEwBw1cAj953c%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=81f88b70&shcp=43f4a2f9&idc=useast8", "preference": -2}, {"id": "cover", "url": "https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-p-0037/octfckGvELApIaEQeAI4A5IADv8zejvhVOTCAd~tplv-tiktokx-dmt-logom:tos-alisg-i-0068/oguymAAuVFDjBAxDE0FEAUD3IQAjgfAQIJfk4e.image?dr=9634&x-expires=1794114000&x-signature=NwQVc9e17DGZI%2ByWiBsoyvjT4sw%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=81f88b70&shcp=43f4a2f9&idc=useast8", "preference": -1}, {"id": "originCover", "url": "https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-p-0037/oghsY3AZiAkmHn9qBYb2aL5iIB3BUTlPPXI1E~tplv-tiktokx-origin.image?dr=9636&x-expires=1794114000&x-signature=i4z9B3BUsPm5d%2FsawPQ4VwrhCPA%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=81f88b70&shcp=43f4a2f9&idc=useast8", "preference": -1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@arch_inside/video/7683674476436884744", "webpage_url_basename": "7683674476436884744", "webpage_url_domain": "tiktok.com", "extractor": "TikTok", "extractor_key": "TikTok", "t